'''Base classes''' (also called '''core classes''') are those [[class]]es that can be taken at character creation, as opposed to the [[prestige class]]es that have requirements that must be met before they can be taken.

In NWN, the base classes are the following:
*[[Barbarian]]
*[[Bard]]
*[[Cleric]]
*[[Druid]]
*[[Fighter]]
*[[Monk]]
*[[Paladin]]
*[[Ranger]]
*[[Rogue]]
*[[Sorcerer]]
*[[Wizard]]


